1
00:00:00,205 --> 00:00:03,125
(Penny:)Sorry. Okay, who wants syrup
and who wants cinnamon sugar?

2
00:00:03,291 --> 00:00:05,331
(Sheldon:)-I want oatmeal.
-Yes, well...

3
00:00:05,502 --> 00:00:08,132
(Penny:)...I want a boyfriend whose roommate
isn't a giant pain in the ass.

4
00:00:08,296 --> 00:00:11,756
LEONARD: Ha, ha.
-I'm sure that will happen soon enough.

5
00:00:12,509 --> 00:00:15,219
(Sheldon:)But in the meantime, I still want oatmeal.

6
00:00:15,679 --> 00:00:17,719
You know what? I give up.
He's impossible.

7
00:00:17,889 --> 00:00:20,979
(Sheldon:)I can't be impossible, I exist.

8
00:00:21,143 --> 00:00:25,313
(Sheldon:)I believe what you meant to say is,
"I give up. He's improbable."

9
00:00:30,777 --> 00:00:33,737
Sheldon, you need to find
a better way of dealing with Penny.

10
00:00:33,905 --> 00:00:35,485
What am I supposed to do?

11
00:00:35,657 --> 00:00:39,997
(Sheldon:)Eat French toast on a Monday?
Now, that would be impossible.

12
00:00:40,412 --> 00:00:43,412
I'm saying you can catch more flies
with honey than vinegar.

13
00:00:43,790 --> 00:00:46,880
(Sheldon:)You can catch even more flies
with manure. What's your point?

14
00:00:47,794 --> 00:00:48,834
(Sheldon:)It's a--

15
00:00:49,004 --> 00:00:50,254
[LEONARD SIGHS]

16
00:00:52,966 --> 00:00:55,506
(Sheldon:)Boy, that does smell good.

17
00:00:55,677 --> 00:01:00,027
(Sheldon:)Too bad it's Monday.

